 r←ReserveRetryPS n;i;got
⍝ Partner of ReserveRetrySP: the same non-blocking retry, but it tries 'PAYMENT'
⍝ first, then 'SEATS'.
⍝ TODO: the opposite order to ReserveRetrySP is what lets the pair livelock.
 :For i :In ⍳n
     got←0
     :Repeat
         :Hold 'PAYMENT'
             {}⎕DL 0.002        ⍝ (widen the race) let the other flow take its first lock
             :Hold 'SEATS'
                 got←1
             :Else
             :EndHold
         :Else
         :EndHold
     :Until got
     :Hold 'DONE' ⋄ DONE+←1 ⋄ :EndHold
 :EndFor
 r←0
